{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play the role of a super warrior who hates evil and comes to a city controlled by gangs. You will encounter the besieged mayor and embark on the path of upholding justice and eliminating evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat countless enemies, constantly explore, collect coins, purchase supplies and equipment, constantly become stronger, and become the hero of the entire city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A refreshing 2D action fighting game that combines fun gameplay from other types of games such as <strong>Metroidvania , 2D Platformer Game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It integrates the operation methods of games such as FC, arcade, PC, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatically shifting back to health, making the game back to simplicity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be no collision damage when in contact with enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having a plethora of abilities right from the start, making the game no longer a torment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple mechanisms: combo, block, dodge, grab, throw, transform.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3334570?t=1759413721","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3334570?t=1759413721","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334570/bc8407ce313feb86cf09354141df05fe7fb914c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759413721","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334570/bc8407ce313feb86cf09354141df05fe7fb914c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759413721","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will play the role of a super warrior who hates evil and comes to a city controlled by gangs. You will encounter the besieged mayor and embark on the path of upholding justice and eliminating evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat countless enemies, constantly explore, collect coins, purchase supplies and equipment, constantly become stronger, and become the hero of the entire city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A refreshing 2D action fighting game that combines fun gameplay from other types of games such as <strong>Metroidvania , 2D Platformer Game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It integrates the operation methods of games such as FC, arcade, PC, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatically shifting back to health, making the game back to simplicity!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be no collision damage when in contact with enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having a plethora of abilities right from the start, making the game no longer a torment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple mechanisms: combo, block, dodge, grab, throw, transform.</p>","developers":["CreatiCell Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334570/3c1a888023020435ab076a000b637b0e1253352d/header.jpg?t=1759413721","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3334570/1522142944/e720c252fe363fc0cf1c709eb84140d73c32d63a/1758872784/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759317275","dash_h264":"ht